WEBVTT

00:20.880 --> 00:26.860
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.920 --> 00:30.690
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.170 --> 00:43.000
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:43.010 --> 00:45.340
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.340 --> 00:48.510
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.510 --> 00:51.480
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.480 --> 00:54.750
Now that I'm strong

00:54.750 --> 00:59.750
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.760 --> 01:03.790
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.790 --> 01:06.860
Where you're waiting

01:06.860 --> 01:09.860
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.870 --> 01:13.030
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.040 --> 01:16.000
You shattered the glass sword

01:16.000 --> 01:18.970
You wielded without thinking

01:18.970 --> 01:21.910
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.910 --> 01:25.380
I lick your wounded fingers

01:43.330 --> 01:46.630
So, this is Sasanaki Town.

02:08.560 --> 02:10.020
It's not enough.

02:10.030 --> 02:13.630
Certainly, Mistress, I will bring you more at once.

02:14.060 --> 02:15.930
I'm not referring to the meal.

02:15.930 --> 02:18.610
I am fully satisfied with your cooking.

02:19.740 --> 02:21.650
I need more servants.

02:22.270 --> 02:23.910
Huga?

02:24.210 --> 02:28.040
Are you not satisfied with myself and Flan?

02:28.040 --> 02:29.850
That's not what I meant.

02:32.980 --> 02:35.280
Things used to be different.

02:35.280 --> 02:38.920
I used to be a princess with my own royal guards.

02:38.920 --> 02:42.160
They were a group of elite soldiers known
as the Knights of the Flame.

02:42.590 --> 02:46.600
Now, all I have is Hiro and Flandre.

02:47.200 --> 02:48.860
I've fallen from grace.

02:48.860 --> 02:50.700
If I had more servants,

02:50.700 --> 02:55.340
a couple of assassins would be a walk in the park.

03:05.010 --> 03:06.820
This tea...

03:09.150 --> 03:11.190
This Earl Grey is delicious.

03:11.190 --> 03:13.120
Did you brew this, Sawawa?

03:13.120 --> 03:14.930
Yes, Mistress.

03:16.790 --> 03:20.460
Would you stop calling me Mistress?

03:20.460 --> 03:22.440
I'm your master.

03:22.760 --> 03:24.840
Certainly, Mistress.

03:37.510 --> 03:41.320
I feel so small when I return to that mansion.

03:46.490 --> 03:50.800
Even a million lives won't suffice
if I keep hanging around Hime.

03:57.270 --> 03:58.900
Ah! Watch out!

04:04.870 --> 04:06.680
No one at the wheel?

04:14.620 --> 04:16.930
HEY! Are you all right?!

04:17.190 --> 04:18.890
Ouch...

04:18.890 --> 04:22.690
Man, it ran right over you.

04:22.690 --> 04:25.830
Don't just stand there watching, help me!

04:25.830 --> 04:29.300
He must have forgotten to use
the emergency brake.

04:29.300 --> 04:32.070
But man, you're slow.

04:32.070 --> 04:34.510
A normal person would have dodged it.

04:34.940 --> 04:37.580
L..l wanted to, but...

04:41.110 --> 04:43.750
I see, that explains it.

04:46.820 --> 04:48.620
Just you wait!

05:00.630 --> 05:03.130
You're a good guy, aren't you?

05:07.740 --> 05:10.470
Wait right here, I'll go call an ambulance.

05:10.470 --> 05:12.650
No, I'll be fine!

05:19.920 --> 05:21.720
Y..You...

05:22.150 --> 05:25.520
I heal from my injuries really quickly.

05:25.520 --> 05:29.820
I guess I'm half-immortal.

05:29.830 --> 05:33.270
So, you're a soldier with the Royal Family?

05:35.360 --> 05:38.340
Tell me where your master is!

05:38.870 --> 05:41.780
Someone is breathing life into you, right?!

05:50.980 --> 05:52.450
Up there, huh?

05:52.450 --> 05:54.260
What's this all about?

05:55.420 --> 06:00.020
Shopping... Shopping...

06:00.020 --> 06:02.800
What shall I buy today?

06:09.260 --> 06:14.260
That's odd, the only thing up the road from
here is the Mistress's mansion.

06:14.440 --> 06:16.420
A Quest?

06:21.980 --> 06:24.950
What about that cat, Flandre?

06:24.950 --> 06:26.310
Huga...

06:26.310 --> 06:30.750
You want me to give it the flame of
life and make it my servant?

06:30.750 --> 06:32.390
Huga!

06:33.090 --> 06:34.390
Don't joke around!

06:34.390 --> 06:37.190
I can't make just any corpse into my servant!

06:37.190 --> 06:39.300
Go bury it in the yard!

06:40.030 --> 06:41.670
Huga.

06:41.760 --> 06:45.500
Flandre, when you're done with that, fix the roof.

06:45.500 --> 06:47.670
Finish it before nightfall.

06:47.670 --> 06:49.310
Huga!

07:02.620 --> 07:06.120
I've found you at last,
the one who killed my brother!

07:07.660 --> 07:09.470
Killed your brother?

07:10.630 --> 07:14.600
From the looks of it, you must be a half-breed.

07:16.100 --> 07:19.700
My name is Liza, Liza Wildman.

07:20.170 --> 07:24.670
I'm here to avenge my brother who was killed
at the hands of you, his own master!

07:24.670 --> 07:27.840
Wildman, right.

07:27.840 --> 07:29.950
He mentioned you before.

07:31.650 --> 07:36.460
He said his only blood relative was
a werewolf and human half-breed.

07:38.390 --> 07:40.290
That must be you, huh?

07:40.290 --> 07:41.960
Yes, now answer me this!

07:41.960 --> 07:44.770
What son of tricks did you employ
to kill my brother?!

07:45.930 --> 07:48.740
I fought him straight on, fair and square.

07:49.900 --> 07:51.710
Don't screw with me!

07:57.070 --> 07:59.850
Why do I feel so uneasy?

08:00.280 --> 08:02.980
You're a good guy,
so I don't want you to get involved.

08:02.980 --> 08:05.820
Listen to me, stay away from that mansion.

08:06.410 --> 08:09.550
What was that all about?
Who is that woman?

08:14.220 --> 08:16.160
S..Sis!

08:16.160 --> 08:17.490
Oh, Hiro.

08:17.490 --> 08:20.000
What's the matter?
Why are you in such a rush?

08:20.430 --> 08:24.630
Did a girl on a motorcycle drive
up to the mansion?

08:24.630 --> 08:27.230
As a matter of fact, yes.

08:27.240 --> 08:29.000
Is she a guest of yours?

08:29.000 --> 08:33.570
Huh? No, not quite...

08:33.580 --> 08:36.440
She's not here to see me, but rather, Hime.

08:36.440 --> 08:38.980
A guest of the Mistress?

08:38.980 --> 08:41.890
Oh no, I have to serve her!

08:42.420 --> 08:44.450
Hey! Wait!

08:44.450 --> 08:47.190
Umm, I'll take care of that.

08:47.190 --> 08:49.230
Really? Are you okay with that?

08:49.690 --> 08:51.560
Yeah, I'll be fine.

08:51.560 --> 08:53.760
So, you just stay away from the mansion...

08:53.760 --> 08:56.940
I mean, just go shopping.

08:59.500 --> 09:02.540
You're such a great guy, Hiro.
You've made your sister very happy.

09:02.540 --> 09:04.670
Okay, I'll let you handle things.

09:04.670 --> 09:06.540
Right, right.

09:06.540 --> 09:10.840
You should serve the guest Earl Grey tea.

09:10.850 --> 09:13.110
The Mistress likes it as well.

09:13.110 --> 09:14.480
Right, right.

09:14.480 --> 09:17.120
And as a side for the tea...

09:17.120 --> 09:18.590
Anything will do!

09:18.590 --> 09:21.920
I need to hurry back to the mansion!

09:21.920 --> 09:24.490
That's right, good luck, Hiro.

09:29.530 --> 09:32.640
Maybe he really had to go to the bathroom?

09:57.230 --> 09:59.030
You're weak!

10:03.430 --> 10:05.070
Huga.

10:13.810 --> 10:15.810
Finally...

10:16.740 --> 10:21.960
I may be half-immortal, but I still lack stamina.

10:26.490 --> 10:28.130
H..Hime!

10:32.430 --> 10:35.360
So, I guess it's true what they say,

10:35.360 --> 10:40.240
until they reach maturity, those of the
royal bloodline are just as weak as humans.

10:43.440 --> 10:44.100
No!

10:46.140 --> 10:47.950
So, he finally arrives.

10:48.440 --> 10:51.410
I told you to stay away!

10:51.410 --> 10:54.280
Why? Why do you want to kill her?

10:54.280 --> 10:56.320
She murdered my brother!

10:56.320 --> 10:57.960
Murdered?

10:59.520 --> 11:02.690
She killed my only brother.

11:02.690 --> 11:06.230
So, for that reason, I'm going to kill her!

11:06.230 --> 11:08.040
Outta my way!

11:11.900 --> 11:13.540
Stop!

11:29.550 --> 11:31.390
Stop this!

11:31.390 --> 11:33.200
Get the hell off of me!

11:33.960 --> 11:35.920
My goodness...

11:35.920 --> 11:39.460
I've never seen a soldier as useless as you.

11:45.470 --> 11:47.070
You're weak!

11:47.070 --> 11:52.310
There's no way a princess as weak as you
could have defeated my brother, a warrior!

11:52.910 --> 11:55.220
You must have employed some cowardly trick!

11:57.280 --> 11:58.680
I said stop!

11:58.680 --> 12:00.350
Stop! Stop it!

12:00.350 --> 12:01.450
Enough!

12:01.450 --> 12:03.220
You're being deceived!

12:03.220 --> 12:06.090
She doesn't value her servants in the least!

12:06.090 --> 12:09.320
She'll kill you the second you get in her way!

12:09.320 --> 12:11.490
That's the kind of person she is!

12:11.490 --> 12:13.470
N..No way...

12:14.030 --> 12:16.980
I will make up for where my brother failed!

12:18.300 --> 12:20.530
I'm afraid that's impossible.

12:20.540 --> 12:22.170
What?!

12:33.380 --> 12:35.880
You're late, Flandre.

12:35.880 --> 12:37.520
Huga.

12:47.200 --> 12:49.130
A..A truck?!

12:49.130 --> 12:51.400
That's fighting dirty, you bitch!

12:51.400 --> 12:55.770
Dirty? You should talk, barging into
someone's home like a barbarian.

12:55.770 --> 12:58.510
I don't recall agreeing to a fair battle.

13:03.980 --> 13:05.380
Flandre, don't let her escape.

13:05.380 --> 13:07.020
Huga?

13:07.980 --> 13:10.760
I need to teach her a lesson.

13:11.420 --> 13:13.060
Ow...

13:28.540 --> 13:30.170
This...

13:31.140 --> 13:34.520
The parfaits in this cafe really are delicious.

13:42.950 --> 13:47.560
Next, I'd like a Special Dandy
Durian Parfait, please!

14:11.180 --> 14:14.130
What's the matter?
Done playing tag already?

14:14.350 --> 14:17.020
This is probably how you killed my brother.

14:17.020 --> 14:18.960
What pan of this is fair and square?!

14:19.690 --> 14:21.560
Foolish child.

14:22.460 --> 14:26.600
You don't even realize that your actions
are shaming your brother's death.

14:32.570 --> 14:34.370
What did you say?

14:34.370 --> 14:36.350
What did you say just now?

14:36.670 --> 14:38.310
Oh?

14:38.370 --> 14:39.610
No matter.

14:39.610 --> 14:41.680
Ram right into her, Flandre.

14:41.680 --> 14:43.310
Huga!

14:45.510 --> 14:47.790
What did you say to me?!

15:12.110 --> 15:13.740
Huga.

15:26.420 --> 15:29.400
What's wrong?
I thought you were going to kill me.

15:31.330 --> 15:32.960
H..Hime...

15:40.330 --> 15:42.040
What did you mean?

15:42.040 --> 15:45.380
How am I shaming my brother's death?

15:46.570 --> 15:48.410
Use your brain.

15:48.410 --> 15:52.380
That is, if your brain can handle it.

15:55.780 --> 15:57.180
What's the matter?

15:57.190 --> 15:58.990
Damn you!

15:58.990 --> 16:00.690
Hime!

16:06.690 --> 16:10.360
Y..You! Why would you go that far for her?

16:10.360 --> 16:13.140
Why go so far for a cruel, cold-hearted bitch?

16:15.870 --> 16:19.410
If you continue to insist on protecting her,
I'll have to...

16:19.410 --> 16:21.050
Stop!

16:26.280 --> 16:30.960
It would be ridiculous to handle both you
and your brother in the same manner.

16:31.150 --> 16:32.790
What?

16:39.230 --> 16:41.040
What are you going to do?

16:41.360 --> 16:42.630
Listen well.

16:42.630 --> 16:46.430
Your brother had already accepted the
ramifications of stabbing his master in the back

16:46.430 --> 16:49.300
by the time he challenged me.

16:49.300 --> 16:52.440
Lies! My brother was an honorable man,
why would he do such a thing?!

16:52.440 --> 16:53.440
He would.

16:53.440 --> 16:55.780
He wouldn't! There's no way!

16:55.780 --> 16:57.020
He would!

16:57.680 --> 17:01.990
If it was to protect you, his only blood relative.

17:02.220 --> 17:03.850
What?!

17:04.550 --> 17:06.650
You may not realize it,

17:06.650 --> 17:09.500
but your life rested in the hands of your enemy.

17:10.160 --> 17:13.530
You were a hostage, essentially.

17:13.530 --> 17:17.140
That's why he had to rebel against me, his master.

17:17.570 --> 17:19.330
It was to protect you.

17:19.330 --> 17:25.280
Mistress Hime, forgive my disrespect please.

17:27.380 --> 17:29.180
That's absurd!

17:31.310 --> 17:35.390
I don't care if you believe me or not.

17:35.850 --> 17:39.550
But the fact of the matter is,
he came and challenged me.

17:39.550 --> 17:43.590
We fought fair and square, and he lost.

17:44.560 --> 17:49.170
He was an honorable werewolf warrior
right to the end.

17:52.900 --> 17:56.800
To live and fight honorably,
and to die in battle...

17:56.800 --> 17:59.770
That's the honor of being a werewolf warrior.

17:59.770 --> 18:02.190
Be proud, Liza.

18:03.080 --> 18:07.150
To die on the battlefield is the
highest honor a warrior can have.

18:07.150 --> 18:09.190
It was a glorious death.

18:09.820 --> 18:13.120
But you've sullied that.

18:13.120 --> 18:18.020
To accuse me of murdering him in cold blood
makes his death sound dishonorable,

18:18.030 --> 18:20.970
like you don't believe his death
was honorable at all.

18:21.430 --> 18:22.930
That's crazy...

18:22.930 --> 18:29.010
You knew all of this and killed
my brother anyway?

18:30.200 --> 18:32.210
It's just as I said before.

18:32.210 --> 18:34.480
I fought him straight on, fair and square.

18:35.110 --> 18:38.520
So, what will it be? Want to
continue this fight to the death?

18:38.950 --> 18:41.720
If that's what you need to do to get over this,

18:41.720 --> 18:43.630
I have no problem with it.

18:44.020 --> 18:46.260
Damn it...

18:47.560 --> 18:51.060
It's obvious that you killed my brother.

18:52.930 --> 18:55.640
And yet, I've lost the desire to kill you.

19:33.430 --> 19:35.070
Brother...

19:35.200 --> 19:41.210
Brother, you always protected me
when the bullies made me cry.

19:43.080 --> 19:47.380
I was a half-breed in a clan of werewolves,

19:47.380 --> 19:50.780
but you were the only one who was kind to me.

19:50.790 --> 19:53.990
You're my only sister.

19:53.990 --> 19:56.620
You're a werewolf warrior.

19:56.620 --> 19:58.430
Be proud.

19:58.790 --> 20:02.400
You always said those words to give me courage.

20:03.230 --> 20:06.800
"Be proud," that was your line.

20:07.370 --> 20:12.410
You valued the pride of being
a warrior more than anyone else.

20:13.770 --> 20:17.040
Even though you died at the
hands of that woman,

20:17.040 --> 20:20.960
she understood your sentiment
better than anyone else.

20:36.630 --> 20:38.270
You!

20:39.030 --> 20:41.770
I'm sorry, my body, it just...

20:41.770 --> 20:44.370
Please take me to Hime.

20:44.370 --> 20:46.010
What?!

20:47.880 --> 20:49.680
You idiot!

20:52.210 --> 20:53.850
Geez...

20:55.020 --> 20:56.830
What an idiot.

21:16.370 --> 21:18.340
I need more servants.

21:18.340 --> 21:19.710
Okay...

21:19.710 --> 21:20.870
Huga.

21:20.880 --> 21:25.250
The uselessness which you two displayed
to me the other day...

21:25.250 --> 21:26.780
It was deplorable.

21:26.780 --> 21:29.620
You weren't there when I needed you
against that one opponent.

21:29.620 --> 21:32.090
What took so long?

21:32.090 --> 21:35.060
If you're going to be a soldier of the Royal Family,

21:35.060 --> 21:37.000
you must never leave your master's side.

21:39.190 --> 21:41.430
Hey, Flandre! Where are you going?

21:41.430 --> 21:43.470
I'm not done talking yet!

21:43.830 --> 21:45.500
Huga.

21:45.500 --> 21:47.230
Oh?

21:47.230 --> 21:49.600
You want me to make that a servant?

21:49.600 --> 21:51.240
Huga?

21:54.410 --> 21:56.680
MY, you've got nerve!

21:56.680 --> 21:58.180
I'll fix that, Flandre!

21:58.180 --> 21:59.750
Turn off your systems!

21:59.750 --> 22:00.210
Huga?

22:00.210 --> 22:02.420
Huga?

22:02.520 --> 22:03.750
Don't try to stop me, Hiro!

22:03.750 --> 22:05.150
I've had about all I can take today!

22:06.450 --> 22:08.150
Hurry, run away, Flandre!

22:08.160 --> 22:09.330
Huga?

22:11.790 --> 22:16.790
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:17.360 --> 22:25.310
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:27.880 --> 22:30.640
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:30.640 --> 22:33.380
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:33.380 --> 22:35.950
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:35.950 --> 22:38.590
Which one goes deeper?

22:38.590 --> 22:41.320
Roses fly from my head

22:41.320 --> 22:44.020
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:44.020 --> 22:46.630
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:46.630 --> 22:49.200
Blood that gushes away

22:49.260 --> 22:51.900
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:51.900 --> 22:54.570
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:54.570 --> 22:57.240
And yet you're still

22:57.240 --> 22:59.940
Seeking love?

22:59.940 --> 23:02.680
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:02.680 --> 23:05.350
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:05.350 --> 23:10.350
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:10.620 --> 23:15.620
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:16.060 --> 23:21.060
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:21.300 --> 23:24.000
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:24.000 --> 23:26.630
But if you still ask for it

23:26.630 --> 23:30.600
Your dying breath just might be

23:30.600 --> 23:38.890
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:40.010 --> 23:41.080
Huga.

23:41.080 --> 23:43.020
This is Hime's vacation house?

23:43.020 --> 23:45.990
Right next to a lake! What a great place!

23:45.990 --> 23:49.300
But why did Hime bring Liza with us?

23:50.220 --> 23:51.960
Because I felt like it.

23:51.960 --> 23:53.960
Hime, something's here!

23:53.960 --> 23:57.260
Relax, they're fishmen.

23:57.260 --> 23:58.970
Huga?

23:58.970 --> 24:01.740
Foolish fishmen, what are you planning to do?

24:02.100 --> 24:04.140
Next episode, "Princess Negotiation"

24:05.370 --> 24:06.210
What's that huge one?!

24:06.770 --> 24:08.620
Huga, huga.
